---
import Figure from "../Figure.astro";
---
<Figure width="wide">
  <div class="two">
    <div class="fig" id="edits"></div>
    <div>
      <p class="lab">π across runs</p>
      <div id="pis"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    <b>Steps up get rarer near the top.</b> Left: each child against its parent; axes are distance to the best known
    value, so the frontier is top right, and points above the diagonal are improvements. Right: upper bar, the share of
    all edits that beat their parent (π); lower bar, the same share at the frontier, for edits whose parent is within
    0.01 of the run's best. Hover a point for its scores.
  </Fragment>
</Figure>
